--------------------------------------------------
C# (Resonance Audio SDK for Unity) - changes are marked "PATCH" in the source:
  Assets/ResonanceAudio/Scripts/ResonanceAudio.cs
    - Listener re-resolved when the cached AudioListener is destroyed/disabled.
    - Volumetric occlusion (several rays to a disc around the source), triggers ignored,
      sample points kept in free space.
    - UpdateReverbProbe(probe, reflectivity) overload used by ResonanceReverbGrid.
    - Reverb-baking functions loaded from "resonanceaudiobake" (renamed stock plugin).
    - PushListenerTransform / SetListenerTransformFromScript import.
  Assets/ResonanceAudio/Scripts/ResonanceAudioSource.cs
    - Occlusion response and level drop (ResonanceOcclusion), air absorption
      (ResonanceAirAbsorption), distance-dependent reverb send (ResonanceReverbGrid),
      "Room Effects Send (dB)" trim.
  Assets/ResonanceAudio/Editor/ResonanceAudioSourceEditor.cs
    - Directivity preview uses its own texture instead of drawing into
      Texture2D.blackTexture; draws the Room Effects Send field.
  Assets/ResonanceAudio/Editor/ResonanceAudioReverbComputer.cs
    - Also bakes every ResonanceReverbGrid in the scene.
  Assets/ResonanceAudio/Editor/ResonanceAudioReverbBakingWindow.cs
    - Bake button enabled when reverb grids exist.

C++ (Resonance Audio) - see Native/per_source_reflections.patch:
  resonance_audio/CMakeLists.txt, resonance_audio/graph/graph_manager.{h,cc},
  platforms/unity/unity_nativeaudioplugins.{h,cc}
    - Per-source early reflections; listener pose settable from script.
  New: resonance_audio/dsp/image_source_reflections.*,
       resonance_audio/graph/per_source_reflections_node.*, and their tests.

The binary plugins in Assets/ResonanceAudio/Plugins/x86_64/ additionally contain
third-party code; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the licenses/ folder.
